/// M26 HISTORY-010 "SQLite persistence: answer semantics".
/// Source: tests/integration/sqlite_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentSQLitePersistence (L43-162); fixture
/// compiler/testdata/current/sql/sqlite.can; seed
/// tests/integration/testdata/sql/sqlite-seed.sql; driver
/// tests/integration/testdata/sql/sqlite-driver.ts.
/// Disposition: migrate (this row ports
/// TestCurrentSQLitePersistence to ordinary Can functions; the old
/// Go harness stays until the integrator retires it after every
/// linked row, variant, environment and control has accepted
/// evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the ten live answers in Go order: the
/// in-memory ok, the add/get file roundtrip, the absent-id and
/// duplicate-body classifications, the commit/abort visibility
/// pair, and the invalid-id refusal; plus the empty-seed setup
/// verdict, the ten/six/four leg counts, both exit codes, and
/// both empty-stream verdicts.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): affected counts
/// pin int (1) from the Go want spellings (L152/L156/L158);
/// leg counts pin int from the ok/fault call sites (6 ok at
/// L151-153/L156-158, 4 fault at L154-155/L159-160, 10 total);
/// exit codes pin int from the status guards (L136/L144);
/// empty-stream verdicts pin bools from the diag/out guards
/// (L136/L144); setup notes pins the 0 spelling from the Go
/// guard (L99); row JSON pins the exact Go backquote spellings
/// (L153/L157). The CLI wants double as offline fixture pins:
/// memory-ok (fixture L19/L28), add 1 (fixture L37), remember
/// row (fixture L61), commit 1 (fixture L121), abort 1 (fixture
/// L145).
/// Facet map (Go verdict legs): mem-out pins memory-ok (L151;
/// fixture L19/L28); add-affected pins 1 (L152; fixture L37);
/// get-row pins the remember JSON (L153; fixture L61);
/// missing-name pins sql::row_missing (L154); duplicate-name pins
/// sql::constraint_failed (L155); commit-affected pins 1 (L156;
/// fixture L121); commit-row pins the kept JSON (L157);
/// abort-affected pins 1 (L158; fixture L145); abort-missing-name
/// pins sql::row_missing (L159); invalid-name pins
/// codec::invalid_data (L160); setup-notes pins 0 (L99-101);
/// total-checks pins 10 (L131-160; log L161); ok-legs pins 6
/// (L151-153/L156-158); fault-legs pins 4 (L154-155/L159-160);
/// ok-status pins 0 (L136); fault-status pins 1 (L144);
/// ok-diag-empty pins true (L136); fault-out-empty pins true
/// (L144).
/// The roots-green pin lives in history-010-roots-green.can;
/// the run shape plus diagnostics live in
/// history-010-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: memory, add/read, missing/duplicate, commit/abort,
/// invalid codec (all in Go order).
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE gates; requires can-bun-archive.
/// Logical gates SUITE/CAN/PROC/CHILD/DB/WORK and C/R/N/S/A
/// identities bind at P23; no live run now. Accept gates
/// P23/QD1 (plus QF1) are unmet. Timeout 360000ms mirrors the
/// Go 6-minute ctx (sqlite_test.go L50).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QD1 unmet).
/// Case history/sqlite-semantics checks: mem-out, add-affected,
/// get-row, missing-name, duplicate-name, commit-affected,
/// commit-row, abort-affected, abort-missing-name, invalid-name,
/// setup-notes, total-checks, ok-legs, fault-legs, ok-status,
/// fault-status, ok-diag-empty, fault-out-empty.
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
